      "text": "Would you choose three quarters of a pizza, or one half? Today we are comparing and ordering fractions. We will build equal-sized wholes, look carefully at the pieces, and use a number line to explain which amount is bigger. What do you predict?",
      "chapter": "Which is bigger?",
      "equation": [
        [
          3,
          4
        ],
        "?",
