      "note": "More equal pieces in a whole means smaller pieces.",
      "line": null,
      "area": null,
      "context": null,
      "role": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "text": "So one third is greater than one sixth. A bigger denominator does not always mean a bigger fraction.",
